<title>USA: Marriott International Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Marriott International Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.80		    $0.68</p>
<p> Net			110,000		   90,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,447,000		2,910,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     139,900		  132,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods are 17 weeks ended January 3, 1997, vs 16 weeks ended December 29, 1995.  </p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p>	  Year</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.24		    $1.87</p>
<p> Net			306,000		  247,000</p>
<p> Revs		  10,172,000		8,961,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     139,200		  132,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Periods are 53 weeks ended January 3, 1997, vs 52 weeks ended December 29, 1995.</p>
<p>Q4 contract services revs $1.56 billion vs $1.24 billion.</p>
<p>Year contract services revs $4.32 billion vs $3.63 billion.</p>
